# .trivyignore — Trivy false-positive exceptions
#
# Add CVE IDs here (one per line) to suppress known false positives
# or vulnerabilities that cannot be fixed yet.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-XXXXX
#
# Example:
#   CVE-2023-12345   # dev-only dep, not reachable in production
#
# Keep this list short and always add a comment explaining why.
